    # source: http://example.org/ontology/identity/tapi-equipment/EQUIPMENT_CATEGORY_SMALL_FORMFACTOR_PLUGGABLE
    skos:definition "A small assembly (compared to a CIRCUIT_PACK) with connectors compatible with those in a holder.\nThe assembly is designed to be mounted in a holder (SLOT) of a CIRCUIT_PACK or STAND_ALONE_UNIT." ;
    lex:canonicalExample "" ;
