    # source: http://example.org/ontology/identity/tapi-equipment/EQUIPMENT_CATEGORY_STAND_ALONE_UNIT
    skos:definition "An assembly with connectors for cabling and potentially with holders.\nThe assembly is designed to be mounted in a freeform environment (on a table or simple mechanical cabinet).\nMay support holders (SLOTs) for CIRCUIT_PACKs or for SMALL_FORMFACTOR_PLUGGABLEs." ;
